{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as stated in the CFO directive of 1 July 2026[[cite:obs-73bc6af41bc0d391468719631983f0077dadac47 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]].\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies[[cite:obs-73bc6af41bc0d391468719631983f0077dadac47 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"e7bea5f7400cd9b26dc8a08270ef14042d43baa8a543a6827d903ba65295e557","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed mention of the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to comply with the directive's precedence and to ensure only the single-signature purchase limit from the CFO directive is stated, with exact citations."}